none\",\"mobileTemplate\":\"\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"item-content\\\"\u003e\\r\\n    \u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"item-top\\\"\u003e\\r\\n        \u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"item-top-title\\\"\u003e\\r\\n            \u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"item-title\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\\\"font-size:1.125rem\\\"\u003e\u0026#8226;\u003c/span\u003e {标题}\u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n    \u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"item-line\\\"\u003e\\r\\n        \u003cdiv style\u003d\\\"text-overflow: ellipsis; overflow: hidden;flex: 0 0 calc(100vw - 13em);\\\"\u003e{发起人}\u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n        \u003cdiv style\u003d\\\"font-size: 0.875rem;flex: 0 0 8.5em;\\\"\u003e{完成时间}\u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/div\u003e\"},\"pageSize\":\"20\",\"vid\":\"eb309b6c-70d4-4ea8-a488-3ef9cf7be4cf_view\",\"pid\":\"eb309b6c-70d4-4ea8-a488-3ef9cf7be4cf_vieweb309b6c-70d4-4ea8-a488-3ef9cf7be4cf_view\",\"C9967A708BE0000154F94030A8C0132DviewFilterType\":\"custom\",\"viewParameterValueType\":\"input\",\"viewCustomFilterValueType\":\"input\",\"mid\":\"eb309b6c-70d4-4ea8-a488-3ef9cf7be4cf_view\",\"2543aabb-4ef9-4671-aa8a-cd9738783958_viewviewFilterType\":\"custom\",\"ff2f255e-790f-4103-a6cf-7d1705469511_viewviewFilterType\":\"custom\",\"forceClearCustomViewStyle\":[\"yes\"],\"9815913e-2510-4f69-9f4a-efa541e29de2_viewviewFilterType\":\"custom\",\"eb4af426-f60b-4c0e-9a2a-a2813e28e68d_viewviewFilterType\":\"custom\",\"648e1002-d73f-4881-9a9a-3138638a61bf_viewviewFilterType\":\"custom\",\"eb309b6c-70d4-4ea8-a488-3ef9cf7be4cf_viewviewFilterType\":\"custom\",\"viewCustomFilterValueOrgType\":[\"unit\"]}",
